comments.text:
I wonder if the first AGI is going to be autistic or not. Will it simply "get" social cues automatically or will it have to reason it all out. "Now WTH did that mean?"

That's the way I live. About half of life flies over my head unless I force myself to think heavily about it. Then I have my AHA moment and the rest of the people are 10 minutes of conversation ahead of me.

{o.o}
